*.o
*.so
*.a
*.exe

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
# Auto-downloaded from GitHub
cmake/HunterGate.cmake
cmake/Hunter/config-depthai.cmake
# OAK plugin pulls DepthAI's vcpkg manifest at configure time (cmake/DepthAIVcpkgManifest.cmake);
# we intentionally do not track our own vcpkg.json.
/vcpkg.json

# Python egg info
*.egg-info/
dist/
*.egg

# SPDX report
project.spdx

# MuJoCo writes this to the CURRENT WORKING DIRECTORY, not next to the model, so
# it lands wherever examples/mujoco_xr happened to be launched from -- commonly
# the repository root -- on every run that logs a warning.
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# robotic_grounding source bundle (cloned locally / in CI from
# jiwenc-nv/v2d:retargeter; never committed -- repopulated deterministically
# from deps/v2d/version.txt). The Teleop wheel build copies this subtree
# into the wheel staging dir so [grounding] users get robotic_grounding
# without a separate install. V2D source must NOT be tracked here.
deps/v2d/src/
deps/v2d/wheels/

# Runtime device files injected by MCP server infrastructure
.mcp.json

# MuJoCo Menagerie, fetched (not vendored) by
# examples/mujoco_xr/scripts/fetch-menagerie.sh at a pinned commit. It unpacks
# INTO the scene directories because a MuJoCo wrapper must be a sibling of the
# robot XML it <include>s, so the authored ar_scene.xml and ~55 MB of fetched
# payload share one directory and only the wrapper is tracked.
#
# THIS RULE MUST STAY IN THE REPOSITORY-ROOT .gitignore and must NOT be moved
# into examples/mujoco_xr/.gitignore: scikit-build-core reads .gitignore
# relative to the PROJECT root (examples/mujoco_xr/), never the git root, so a
# rule there would also delete the payload from the wheel -- and `--scene
# so101` would then fail from site-packages with nothing to explain it. Same
# asymmetry the `*.so` note in examples/mujoco_xr/pyproject.toml describes,
# used in the opposite direction.
/examples/mujoco_xr/python/isaacteleop_examples/mujoco_xr/assets/franka/*
/examples/mujoco_xr/python/isaacteleop_examples/mujoco_xr/assets/so101/*
!/examples/mujoco_xr/python/isaacteleop_examples/mujoco_xr/assets/*/ar_scene.xml
